Key Concepts to Memorise

|Concept                   |Meaning                                                                    |
|--------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|**RAG**                   |Retrieve relevant project information before asking an LLM to generate     |
|**Single source of truth**|Shared documentation all agents reference                                  |
|**Design drift**          |Gradual movement away from the original game vision                        |
|**Structured output**     |AI output formatted so software/game engines can directly consume it       |
|**Human review gate**     |A point where a person approves AI-generated changes                       |
|**Critic agent**          |An AI agent responsible for evaluating another agent’s output              |
|**Generate 10, keep 3**   |Produce many candidates, select the strongest and iterate                  |
|**Persona control**       |Defining voice, personality, knowledge and behaviour                       |
|**Content pipeline**      |Repeatable process that turns game documentation into usable assets/content|
