Quick Revision Summary

If only five ideas are remembered from this lecture, remember these:

1. Your GDD should be the source of truth for your AI agents.
2. RAG makes agents retrieve relevant game information before generating.
3. Generate multiple options, evaluate them and refine the strongest ones.
4. Use critic agents plus human approval gates to prevent drift.
5. Build pipelines that create structured, usable game content—not just paragraphs of AI text.

